[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11223.03, "timestamp": "03:07:03", "text": "呃，他们不是每年都发行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11226.07, "timestamp": "03:07:06", "text": "哦，但是，是不是每六年一次？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11228.55, "timestamp": "03:07:08", "text": "或者五年？不，没有像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11231.75, "timestamp": "03:07:11", "text": "没有固定的时间长度。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11233.51, "timestamp": "03:07:13", "text": "就这样。那时候就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11237.429, "timestamp": "03:07:17", "text": "DND 5e 大约在 2014 年发布。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11239.91, "timestamp": "03:07:19", "text": "然后，呃，最近在2024年，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11242.63, "timestamp": "03:07:22", "text": "发布新规则"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11245.349, "timestamp": "03:07:25", "text": "放。所以，大家都就这么叫它了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11249.269, "timestamp": "03:07:29", "text": "2014 年规则和 2024 年规则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11251.99, "timestamp": "03:07:31", "text": "哦，好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11254.469, "timestamp": "03:07:34", "text": "但它们非常相似。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11256.15, "timestamp": "03:07:36", "text": "而且它们之间也兼容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11262.87, "timestamp": "03:07:42", "text": "哦。哦，等等。好的。是的。呃，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11264.309, "timestamp": "03:07:44", "text": "不需要，不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11266.79, "timestamp": "03:07:46", "text": "那。别担心。呃，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11268.469, "timestamp": "03:07:48", "text": "自制的东西。你不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.11, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "关于那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.15, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11274.63, "timestamp": "03:07:54", "text": "如果你是哦，好的。它确实加载成功了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11276.95, "timestamp": "03:07:56", "text": "我的天哪。是的。好的。我的意思是，你会这样做吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11278.07, "timestamp": "03:07:58", "text": "你想改变这个结果吗？如果你想"}]